    a number called 'the size' is 'the prefix length' add 1 add 'the suffix length'.
    a number called 'the position' is 'the prefix length' add 1.
    a text called 'the text stem' is 'gen flow witness name'.
    a text called 'the text name' is 'the text stem'.
    a text called 'the buffer stem' is 'gen flow witness name'.
    a text called 'the buffer name' is 'the buffer stem'.
